html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#090b0b"><meta name="description" content="24 runnable coding projects by Sharanya Pal across IAM, Python, Java, AI, machine learning, JavaScript, games, and databases."><meta property="og:title" content="Sharanya Pal — The Build Vault"><meta property="og:description" content="24 projects. 12 interactive demos. One complete engineering showcase."><title>The Build Vault · Sharanya Pal</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/gallery.css"></head><body><nav><div class="wrap nav"><a class="logo" href="#home">SP<i>.</i> / THE BUILD VAULT</a><div class="navlinks"><a href="#projects">Explore</a><a href="#featured">Featured</a><a class="minor" href="https://github.com/sharanyapal/sharanya-pal-portfolio/tree/main/labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a></div><div class="navstatus"><span class="dot"></span>LIVE PROJECT ARCHIVE</div></div></nav><main><section class="hero wrap" id="home"><div><div class="eyebrow">● SHARANYA PAL / INTERACTIVE DEVELOPMENT ARCHIVE / 2026</div><h1>IDEAS.<br>BUILT.<br><em>SHIPPED.</em></h1><p>Where cybersecurity meets code. A playable collection of real projects in JavaScript, Python, Java, machine learning, AI workflows, and databases. Explore working demos, then inspect the engineering behind them.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="btn" href="#projects">Explore the vault ↘</a><a class="btn outline" href="https://github.com/sharanyapal/sharanya-pal-portfolio/tree/main/labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View source ↗</a></div></div><div class="console" aria-label="Terminal illustration"><div class="consolebar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><small>sharanya@dev-labs ~/showcase</small></div><div class="consolebody"><div class="fade"># Engineering in public</div><div><span class="lime">$</span> python -m labs.build</div><div>Building <span class="orange">24</span> projects...</div><br><div>✓ <span class="lime">12</span> browser applications</div><div>✓ <span class="lime">07</span> Python / AI / ML tools</div><div>✓ <span class="lime">04</span> Java systems</div><div>✓ <span class="lime">01</span> SQL analytics lab</div><br><div><span class="lime">$</span> git push origin main</div><div class="lime">Code is the proof. <span class="cursor">▋</span></div></div></div></section><div class="statbar wrap"><div class="stat"><strong>24</strong><small>Original projects</small></div><div class="stat"><strong>12</strong><small>Live demos</small></div><div class="stat"><strong>4+</strong><small>Languages & toolchains</small></div><div class="stat"><strong>0</strong><small>Paywalls to explore</small></div></div><section class="wrap" id="projects"><div class="sectionhead"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / DISCOVER</div><h2>THE <em>PROJECT VAULT.</em></h2></div><p>Browse by skill, search a technology, save favorites, or launch an interactive demo directly in your browser.</p></div><div class="toolbar"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects"><button class="filter active" data-filter="All">All / 24</button><button class="filter" data-filter="Live">Playable / 12</button><button class="filter" data-filter="Security">Security</button><button class="filter" data-filter="AI">AI + ML</button><button class="filter" data-filter="Python">Python</button><button class="filter" data-filter="Java">Java</button><button class="filter" data-filter="Data">Data + SQL</button><button class="filter" data-filter="Favorites">★ Saved</button></div><input class="search" id="search" aria-label="Search projects" placeholder="Search projects... ( / )"></div><div class="results" id="count" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="catalog" id="grid"></div></section><section class="feature wrap" id="featured"><div class="copy"><div class="eyebrow">02 / DEEPER THAN DEMOS</div><h2>BUILT TO BE<br>INSPECTED<span style="color:var(--lime)">.</span></h2><p>Each project ships with readable code and run instructions. The Python tools cover grounded retrieval, access controls, ML evaluation, and monitoring. Java labs demonstrate algorithms, OOP, and reliable state management.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/sharanyapal/sharanya-pal-portfolio/tree/main/labs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Browse the code ↗</a></div></div><div class="deco"><div class="ascii">[ SELECT * ]<br>[ FROM ideas ]<br>[ WHERE built = 1 ]<br>→ 24 RESULTS</div></div></section></main><footer class="footer wrap"><div>© 2026 Sharanya Pal. Designed + engineered with curiosity.</div><div><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sharanya-pal-a9a637187/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn ↗</a> &nbsp; / &nbsp; <a href="https://github.com/sharanyapal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a> &nbsp; / &nbsp; <a href="https://sharanya-pal-cinematic-portfolio.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Portfolio ↗</a></div></footer><dialog class="dialog" id="details" aria-labelledby="detailsTitle"><button class="close" id="close" aria-label="Close details">✕</button><div class="eyebrow" id="detailsLabel"></div><h3 id="detailsTitle"></h3><p id="detailsDesc"></p><p><code id="detailsTech"></code></p><div class="buttons" id="detailsActions"></div></dialog><script src="assets/gallery.js"></script></body></html>'''
